      "mergeID": "6ac64ac64f187df51a5b7491",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I’ve noticed a possible issue with PB synchronization in the latest version (build ID: 25738324). Here are the results of my own testing.\n\nI first uploaded the original Shinano 1.02 model without face tracking. PB synchronization worked normally, and both I and other players could see PB grab interactions.\n\nI then uploaded Shinano 1.02 with face tracking added. After that, other players could no longer see my PB grab interactions. Disabling the face tracking feature did not resolve the issue.\n\nWhen I disabled OSC in VRChat, PB synchronization returned to normal, and other players could see the grab interactions again.\n\nPlease look into this.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "PB Grab Sync Issue with OSC Enabled",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6ac5842d25f7b6e35b5c7186",
