      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "This issue was due to a server side change related to the system which syncs station sit state, physbone grabbing and avatar parameters.\n\nOne of the easier repro methods as mentioned in one of the merged posts is sitting in a station then altering avatar parameters.\n\nI've now partially rolled back the change, funnily the part in which was explicitly trying to avoid this kind of issue. If you can still repro the issue do post back here",
